WEBVTT

00:00:08.880 --> 00:00:10.060
Onii-chan.

00:00:14.320 --> 00:00:16.420
Onii-chan, it's morning.

00:00:18.650 --> 00:00:19.540
Good morning.

00:00:21.340 --> 00:00:25.790
If you don't say "Good morning, meow," I won't wake up, meow.

00:00:25.790 --> 00:00:27.510
Breakfast is ready.

00:00:39.210 --> 00:00:41.060
My first love...

00:00:43.530 --> 00:00:44.560
...was you.

00:00:44.560 --> 00:00:45.570
Riko.

00:00:46.180 --> 00:00:47.060
I'm sorry...

00:00:48.170 --> 00:00:50.120
So that's your answer...

00:00:50.120 --> 00:00:51.530
I'm sorry...

00:00:53.090 --> 00:00:54.350
Man!

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:02.660
W-What's up with this heat!?

00:01:29.950 --> 00:01:31.300
Gift, huh?

00:01:43.260 --> 00:01:47.180
tomodachi ni mo ienakatta

00:01:48.360 --> 00:01:52.510
omoi wo tojikometa mama no

00:01:53.680 --> 00:01:57.600
kokoro no naka mahou no furuutsu

00:01:58.730 --> 00:02:02.570
tabereba tsutawaru... nante ne

00:02:03.820 --> 00:02:08.180
kyoushitsu de matteita no, mada

00:02:09.080 --> 00:02:13.180
guuzen da to iiwake shiteru

00:02:13.420 --> 00:02:18.770
sono egao wa tabun dareka no mono

00:02:18.770 --> 00:02:24.230
yume ga watashi no negai wo kanaeru nara

00:02:24.230 --> 00:02:29.180
sotto agetai purezento yo

00:02:29.180 --> 00:02:34.350
anata no niji shiawase ni todoku

00:02:34.350 --> 00:02:39.310
hashi e to kaeru wa te wo futte ne

00:02:39.520 --> 00:02:44.590
ii no ii no

00:02:44.590 --> 00:02:49.940
mitsumeteitai dake nano...

00:03:03.990 --> 00:03:10.960
<i>The Passing Summer</i>

00:03:06.010 --> 00:03:07.770
So hot...

00:03:08.440 --> 00:03:12.200
Even the humidity is like the average Japanese summer.

00:03:13.380 --> 00:03:16.520
At least the laundry seems to dry quickly this way.

00:03:17.690 --> 00:03:20.620
I'm surprised Dad can keep sleeping like this.

00:03:21.340 --> 00:03:23.330
He turned on the airco.

00:03:26.290 --> 00:03:28.690
Maybe I should go buy some ice cream!

00:03:30.040 --> 00:03:32.180
What about you?

00:03:34.650 --> 00:03:35.980
I'm fine.

00:03:43.970 --> 00:03:44.950
Hello?

00:03:46.190 --> 00:03:47.460
Today?

00:03:47.460 --> 00:03:49.010
Right now?

00:03:49.010 --> 00:03:50.750
No, I...

00:03:51.430 --> 00:03:52.980
Hey, hey!

00:03:52.980 --> 00:03:53.670
Hey!

00:03:57.400 --> 00:03:59.280
Hey, Riko...

00:04:00.990 --> 00:04:01.920
What is it?

00:04:01.920 --> 00:04:07.560
Maki just suggested we go to the beach with everyone.

00:04:07.560 --> 00:04:11.620
He asked us both to come...

00:04:16.460 --> 00:04:17.470
Okay.

00:04:31.080 --> 00:04:34.570
To think you'd get excited by something this unscientific...

00:04:34.570 --> 00:04:38.380
It's not really something I like to do, but I figured it was necessary for you.

00:04:38.970 --> 00:04:40.050
Necessary?

00:04:40.050 --> 00:04:42.190
To let out your emotions.

00:04:42.940 --> 00:04:45.300
They seem to be accumulating.

00:04:47.110 --> 00:04:48.760
I don't...!

00:04:48.760 --> 00:04:49.850
Sorry for the wait!

00:04:57.420 --> 00:04:59.580
Sorry we're late!

00:04:59.580 --> 00:05:02.950
We went to buy some new swimsuits for the occasion!

00:05:03.410 --> 00:05:05.650
So? It looks cute, doesn't it?

00:05:05.650 --> 00:05:08.290
I'm wearing the same one as last year.

00:05:09.270 --> 00:05:12.650
It's gotten really small though.

00:05:15.030 --> 00:05:18.750
No... you really can't grow that much in just a year...

00:05:18.750 --> 00:05:21.380
Sorry for coming along as well.

00:05:21.380 --> 00:05:23.170
It's fine!

00:05:23.680 --> 00:05:27.030
The more the merrier, right?

00:05:27.720 --> 00:05:31.600
That's right! It'll help me out if we're with more people!

00:05:31.600 --> 00:05:32.930
Help you out?

00:05:34.020 --> 00:05:36.290
What shall we do for a start!?

00:05:36.290 --> 00:05:39.030
Rinka-chan! Let's ride a banana boat!

00:05:39.030 --> 00:05:41.020
All right, a banana boat—

00:05:43.750 --> 00:05:45.530
Err, who are you?

00:05:45.880 --> 00:05:49.610
Rinka-chan would look so cool splitting through the wind!

00:05:50.000 --> 00:05:53.070
Your long hair flowing in the wind, totally great!

00:05:50.040 --> 00:05:51.120
- Hello?

00:05:51.120 --> 00:05:52.120
- Are you listening?

00:05:53.070 --> 00:05:58.440
Oh, but if you're wearing a life-jacket, I can't see your swimsuit anymore...

00:05:58.440 --> 00:06:00.070
And it looks so great on you!

00:05:58.590 --> 00:05:59.430
- Hey now.

00:06:00.070 --> 00:06:03.750
Oh well! Rinka-chan looks wonderful in anything!

00:06:04.750 --> 00:06:07.720
Listen when people talk to you!!!

00:06:08.050 --> 00:06:10.730
Her name is Satou Nami-san.

00:06:10.730 --> 00:06:16.100
She was saved by Rinka when she got in trouble. She's been following her around ever since.

00:06:16.100 --> 00:06:19.480
Damn, she completely ignored me...

00:06:19.480 --> 00:06:22.040
I-I'm sorry, Sempai.

00:06:22.040 --> 00:06:23.990
It's not your fault, Rinka.

00:06:23.990 --> 00:06:24.880
Rinka?

00:06:24.880 --> 00:06:27.430
But I'm responsible for this...

00:06:27.430 --> 00:06:29.130
No, no, it's just this girl...

00:06:30.590 --> 00:06:33.740
What are you to Rinka-chan?

00:06:33.740 --> 00:06:35.830
What about you?

00:06:35.830 --> 00:06:39.750
Hey! Let's drop it and go swimming!

00:06:40.170 --> 00:06:42.730
I guess you're right! Let's go, Rinka-chan!

00:06:45.000 --> 00:06:47.510
What's up with that girl?

00:06:47.510 --> 00:06:51.520
Come on everyone, while it's still summer, please!

00:06:52.890 --> 00:06:54.290
You're right!

00:06:54.290 --> 00:06:55.560
All right, let's go!

00:06:55.560 --> 00:06:57.220
Yeah, let's go!

00:06:57.530 --> 00:06:58.960
Come on, Kirino-chan!

00:07:04.220 --> 00:07:06.020
That's the way, Amami.

00:07:06.020 --> 00:07:11.260
Make use of this opportunity to mend your relationship with Fukamine-san!

00:07:21.000 --> 00:07:22.940
Please do your best.

00:07:23.820 --> 00:07:25.070
Here it comes!

00:07:26.550 --> 00:07:27.960
Rinka-chan!

00:07:27.960 --> 00:07:30.420
Nami, pass it to other people as well!

00:07:30.420 --> 00:07:31.380
Sempai!

00:07:32.490 --> 00:07:33.390
Riko!

00:07:38.220 --> 00:07:40.810
I'm sorry! I missed!

00:07:45.510 --> 00:07:48.090
Rika-chan, you're giving up Haruhiko-kun?

00:07:48.090 --> 00:07:51.570
But Riko-chan, didn't you...

00:07:51.570 --> 00:07:54.700
It's fine now. Sorry, Kirino-chan.

00:08:01.250 --> 00:08:03.190
Here it comes!

00:08:03.190 --> 00:08:05.070
Our number one receiver!

00:08:06.800 --> 00:08:14.260
It is time to commence our main event, "Watermelon Crush!"

00:08:14.600 --> 00:08:17.010
Just call it "watermelon splitting" like it's supposed to.

00:08:17.010 --> 00:08:19.490
Any challengers?

00:08:19.490 --> 00:08:21.960
If not, I will designate one!

00:08:22.440 --> 00:08:25.100
Our lead-off batter will be...

00:08:25.100 --> 00:08:27.050
You, Fukamine-san!

00:08:27.830 --> 00:08:28.940
Me?

00:08:28.940 --> 00:08:30.810
And her guide will be...

00:08:30.810 --> 00:08:31.640
Amami!

00:08:31.640 --> 00:08:32.490
Me?!

00:08:32.960 --> 00:08:34.820
Please do your best!

00:08:35.430 --> 00:08:38.930
All you need to do is smash the watermelon with this stick.

00:08:38.930 --> 00:08:42.200
Err, yeah, I know that but... umm...

00:08:42.630 --> 00:08:44.670
Kirino, what about you?

00:08:45.190 --> 00:08:47.280
But I'm not really good at these things...

00:08:48.080 --> 00:08:50.590
Kirinon, go for it!

00:08:50.590 --> 00:08:52.140
Go!

00:08:52.820 --> 00:08:54.410
Kirino, straight ahead!

00:08:54.410 --> 00:08:55.430
Straight ahead!

00:08:54.760 --> 00:08:56.590
- Fight, Kirino!

00:09:00.990 --> 00:09:03.130
Kirino! Go! Go!

00:09:04.790 --> 00:09:07.300
All right, and swing!

00:09:14.160 --> 00:09:16.400
Wait, what the heck was that!?

00:09:16.780 --> 00:09:18.160
It's my new invention.

00:09:18.160 --> 00:09:21.410
The "Watermelon Crush Marvelous Machine!"

00:09:24.130 --> 00:09:27.040
How are we supposed to do this blindfolded!?

00:09:27.170 --> 00:09:28.170
Oh?

00:09:28.170 --> 00:09:29.580
Already giving up?

00:09:29.580 --> 00:09:30.300
No.

00:09:31.000 --> 00:09:31.960
I will do it.

00:09:33.660 --> 00:09:35.760
Rinka-chan, go for it!

00:09:35.760 --> 00:09:37.570
In that case...

00:09:37.570 --> 00:09:39.510
I'll start getting serious as well!

00:09:56.740 --> 00:09:59.560
Rinka-chan, awesome!

00:09:59.560 --> 00:10:00.970
You're good.

00:10:00.970 --> 00:10:02.660
But how will you handle this?

00:10:03.490 --> 00:10:06.370
Have a taste of the power of science!

00:10:12.620 --> 00:10:14.660
Here. Please eat.

00:10:14.660 --> 00:10:15.830
Thanks!

00:10:17.010 --> 00:10:19.220
S-Science has...

00:10:22.050 --> 00:10:22.850
Here.

00:10:25.970 --> 00:10:27.130
Thanks.

00:10:31.690 --> 00:10:32.780
See you.

00:10:40.770 --> 00:10:42.500
Everyone!

00:10:42.500 --> 00:10:45.830
Would you like to have some watermelon?

00:10:46.520 --> 00:10:49.180
Edo-san has brought along so many...

00:10:49.180 --> 00:10:51.240
Wow, thanks Edo-kun!

00:10:51.240 --> 00:10:52.730
No idea who that is though.

00:10:52.730 --> 00:10:54.070
What a nice guy!

00:10:54.070 --> 00:10:55.730
You're welcome.

00:10:57.360 --> 00:10:59.090
Haruhiko-kun!

00:10:59.460 --> 00:11:01.090
I brought some salt!

00:11:02.110 --> 00:11:03.200
Thoughtful of you.

00:11:06.420 --> 00:11:08.130
Hey now...

00:11:08.130 --> 00:11:09.880
Sorry, I'll go wash it off!

00:11:25.180 --> 00:11:28.420
Wait up, Onii-chan!

00:11:30.860 --> 00:11:32.590
Quickly!

00:11:41.030 --> 00:11:42.550
So pretty...

00:11:45.980 --> 00:11:49.350
Here is where you can see the rainbow the biggest.

00:11:53.580 --> 00:11:55.560
It's almost disappearing...

00:11:56.040 --> 00:11:58.530
Let's go watch it again here sometime.

00:11:58.530 --> 00:12:00.650
I'll take you along.

00:12:02.550 --> 00:12:06.030
We'll be together forever from now, right?

00:12:06.030 --> 00:12:09.010
Together... forever?

00:12:09.760 --> 00:12:11.080
Yeah!

00:12:15.720 --> 00:12:16.790
Sorry to make you wait.

00:12:16.790 --> 00:12:18.500
Took you long enough!

00:12:18.790 --> 00:12:19.960
Sorry.

00:12:24.430 --> 00:12:26.210
Salty!

00:12:26.210 --> 00:12:28.010
But I properly washed it...

00:12:28.010 --> 00:12:29.140
...in the sea.

00:12:29.140 --> 00:12:30.540
In the sea!?

00:12:31.640 --> 00:12:35.420
Do you hold some kind of grudge against my kidneys!?

00:12:36.240 --> 00:12:38.150
I'm sorry...

00:12:42.940 --> 00:12:45.750
No signs whatsoever of them confronting each other.

00:12:45.750 --> 00:12:48.380
I guess I'll have to provoke things a little bit more...

00:12:56.550 --> 00:12:58.200
A courage test?

00:12:59.210 --> 00:13:01.000
It's a little surprise by me.

00:13:01.940 --> 00:13:04.800
I will explain the rules now.

00:13:04.800 --> 00:13:06.760
They are very simple though.

00:13:07.190 --> 00:13:10.480
We will make pairs of two and depart five minutes after one another.

00:13:10.480 --> 00:13:15.300
Cross this windbreak forest to arrive at the goal point, Narasaki Shrine.

00:13:16.190 --> 00:13:18.900
It's a conventional course, but it seems like fun!

00:13:18.900 --> 00:13:21.610
I hope it stays "fun."

00:13:21.610 --> 00:13:23.610
W-What do you mean?

00:13:24.240 --> 00:13:26.990
This is just something I heard, but...

00:13:28.000 --> 00:13:32.000
One night, a man was walking through this forest.

00:13:32.000 --> 00:13:34.890
Suddenly, through the sound of the waves, he heard a voice coming from somewhere.

00:13:34.890 --> 00:13:37.420
"Heey! Heey!"

00:13:40.770 --> 00:13:45.350
He thought it was just his imagination, but the cries showed no sign of ceasing.

00:13:45.350 --> 00:13:48.530
"Heey! Heey!"

00:13:54.930 --> 00:13:58.410
The frightened man blurted out without thinking,

00:13:59.090 --> 00:14:01.070
"Is someone there!?"

00:14:01.070 --> 00:14:02.440
At that moment...

00:14:02.850 --> 00:14:04.910
"I'm right here!"

00:14:13.000 --> 00:14:14.070
Well then.

00:14:14.740 --> 00:14:17.080
We will now hold the draw to decide the pairings.

00:14:18.700 --> 00:14:21.210
These chopsticks look pretty mechanical.

00:14:21.650 --> 00:14:23.180
They are not "chopsticks."

00:14:23.180 --> 00:14:26.090
These are my original items, "Lottery Sticks!"

00:14:30.170 --> 00:14:31.720
Something lit up.

00:14:33.090 --> 00:14:35.330
Huh? Mine's green.

00:14:35.330 --> 00:14:37.390
I have green as well.

00:14:37.390 --> 00:14:40.310
Two people with the same color form a pair.

00:14:43.310 --> 00:14:45.320
I'm with Rinka-chan!

00:14:45.320 --> 00:14:47.190
Come on, you two as well.

00:15:17.810 --> 00:15:19.080
Are you okay?

00:15:19.980 --> 00:15:22.190
You were never one for horror movies, were you?

00:15:22.990 --> 00:15:24.160
If you're scared...

00:15:29.770 --> 00:15:30.780
That's okay...

00:15:31.530 --> 00:15:32.910
Thanks.

00:15:34.650 --> 00:15:36.560
Then let's hurry.

00:15:38.300 --> 00:15:39.120
Okay.

00:15:42.130 --> 00:15:44.140
It's strange. It is illogical!

00:15:44.140 --> 00:15:46.530
Don't you think so, Konosaka-san?

00:15:50.090 --> 00:15:52.220
Just the two of them on a courage test.

00:15:55.470 --> 00:15:57.570
The terror pressing upon them!

00:15:59.390 --> 00:16:01.800
Closing the distance between each other!

00:16:03.890 --> 00:16:04.980
Stroke, stroke.

00:16:05.730 --> 00:16:08.160
They are the close siblings they used to be!

00:16:09.100 --> 00:16:10.870
That was supposed to happen!

00:16:11.460 --> 00:16:15.280
Why doesn't he do anything I want him to!?

00:16:15.280 --> 00:16:16.580
Damn it!

00:16:16.580 --> 00:16:21.870
Had I started preparing a little sooner, I could have set up all kinds of traps to make this test a living hell!

00:16:24.420 --> 00:16:27.420
Is something troubling you?

00:16:28.070 --> 00:16:30.700
Haven't I seen you somewhere before?

00:16:31.270 --> 00:16:34.180
No... I'm sure it's just your imagination.

00:16:34.180 --> 00:16:37.890
Could you be the rumored witch I've been hearing about?

00:16:38.330 --> 00:16:39.700
Correct!

00:16:40.230 --> 00:16:43.480
I'll make any wishes you have come true.

00:16:43.480 --> 00:16:44.480
Then...

00:16:45.130 --> 00:16:48.150
Who has the most powerful military in the world?

00:16:48.150 --> 00:16:49.980
I want to take them on!

00:16:50.770 --> 00:16:53.320
Err, no, I can't help you with that.

00:16:53.320 --> 00:16:55.690
Come on, didn't you say it just now?

00:16:55.690 --> 00:16:56.400
Just now?

00:16:58.280 --> 00:17:01.890
Are you talking about how I wanted this courage test to be a living hell?

00:17:02.580 --> 00:17:03.540
That's it!

00:17:04.800 --> 00:17:08.380
However, I don't really want to rely on unscientific things...

00:17:08.770 --> 00:17:10.240
Oh, who cares?

00:17:10.860 --> 00:17:12.260
Put up your hands.

00:17:18.800 --> 00:17:20.010
Gift?

00:17:29.720 --> 00:17:31.480
They sure lack uniformity.

00:17:44.780 --> 00:17:46.720
Was that Kirino-chan...?

00:17:53.530 --> 00:17:55.920
What the heck are these!?

00:17:55.920 --> 00:17:57.550
How should I know!?

00:18:03.430 --> 00:18:06.730
Onii-chan!!!

00:18:07.460 --> 00:18:08.900
Riko!!!

00:18:10.270 --> 00:18:12.290
I will protect you even if it costs me my life.

00:18:12.290 --> 00:18:13.390
Hiroshi-san...

00:18:19.600 --> 00:18:21.350
Don't mess with me!

00:18:21.350 --> 00:18:23.910
I'll send you to hell, you bastard!

00:18:41.140 --> 00:18:43.010
Rinka-chan, awesome!

00:18:45.410 --> 00:18:47.480
Ghosts!

00:18:47.480 --> 00:18:49.850
I will curse you...

00:18:49.850 --> 00:18:51.350
Oh boy...

00:18:51.350 --> 00:18:54.610
This is getting kinda out of hand...

00:18:54.610 --> 00:18:55.610
What should I do?

00:18:56.930 --> 00:18:57.970
Oh well.

00:19:02.780 --> 00:19:03.780
Riko!

00:19:13.040 --> 00:19:16.130
I will have your guts!

00:19:21.820 --> 00:19:24.510
Kirino!

00:19:34.520 --> 00:19:36.270
Kirino, are you okay!?

00:19:41.470 --> 00:19:43.940
H-Hey, where's Maki?

00:19:47.130 --> 00:19:48.620
I was so scared!

00:19:50.420 --> 00:19:52.130
It's all right now...

00:19:59.800 --> 00:20:01.720
Onii-chan...

00:20:01.720 --> 00:20:04.100
Where did you go!?

00:20:04.100 --> 00:20:05.600
Heey!

00:20:11.140 --> 00:20:12.020
Hey.

00:20:12.900 --> 00:20:14.520
Edo-kun!

00:20:15.520 --> 00:20:16.620
Where's Amami?

00:20:18.330 --> 00:20:19.910
What about Kirino-chan?

00:20:19.910 --> 00:20:21.830
We got separated as well.

00:20:21.830 --> 00:20:23.030
I see...

00:20:24.340 --> 00:20:27.780
I knew it was a mistake to rely on something as frivolous as magic!

00:20:27.780 --> 00:20:29.230
What are you talking about?

00:20:29.230 --> 00:20:32.650
Never mind. We have to search for Amami.

00:20:32.650 --> 00:20:35.890
Yeah. We have to find Kirino-chan as well.

00:20:42.610 --> 00:20:43.840
Kirino-chan?

00:21:36.100 --> 00:21:38.310
I'm such a fool...

00:21:39.270 --> 00:21:40.650
By now...

00:21:47.540 --> 00:21:49.810
<i>I...</i>

00:21:50.710 --> 00:21:53.850
<i>...like Onii-chan after all.</i>

00:22:15.030 --> 00:22:19.210
kyoushitsu no sumikko de

00:22:20.100 --> 00:22:25.800
kuchizusanda okiniiri no uta

00:22:26.620 --> 00:22:31.730
naze ka kyou wa kanashii kimochi ga

00:22:32.770 --> 00:22:35.960
afureteshimatta yo

00:22:37.510 --> 00:22:43.000
okaeri, watashi  machi wa yasashiku

00:22:43.000 --> 00:22:46.790
mukaetekureru no

00:22:46.790 --> 00:22:50.980
nee anata ni aitai na

00:22:52.540 --> 00:22:58.100
umaku waraetenai toki wa sotto oshiete hoshii

00:22:58.100 --> 00:23:03.020
hikikaesenakunaru mae ni

00:23:04.090 --> 00:23:06.970
futari kokoroniji wo kakete

00:23:06.970 --> 00:23:09.780
hitori ja nai to itte ne

00:23:09.780 --> 00:23:15.870
inori ga todokimasu youni

00:23:33.790 --> 00:23:36.930
There is something I must do.

00:23:37.410 --> 00:23:41.690
The promise I made that day with the person I hold most dearly.

00:23:42.180 --> 00:23:46.440
That is why I continue to hone my skills.

00:23:46.440 --> 00:23:48.450
I thought that doing just that was fine.

00:23:49.480 --> 00:23:53.210
Without ever realizing someone's feelings towards me.

00:23:52.820 --> 00:24:02.830
<i>At the Closed Place</i>

00:23:54.340 --> 00:23:57.310
Next time, "At the Closed Place."

00:23:58.200 --> 00:24:01.460
Who will you give your Gift?
